---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Quintanamur S.L. - Potencia Industrial al Servicio de la Obra y el Campo"
  description="Acondicionamiento extremo de terrenos, excavaciones, despedregado y plantación GPS en Yecla, Jumilla y comarca. Maquinaria propia sin intermediarios."
  activePage="inicio"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-inverse-surface relative overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-32">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none"
      style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=\'60\' height=\'60\' viewBox=\'0 0 60 60\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cg fill=\'none\' fill-rule=\'evenodd\'%3E%3Cg fill=\'%23ffffff\' fill-opacity=\'1\'%3E%3Cpath d=\'M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z\'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E');"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="relative max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop z-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center"
    >
      <div class="md:col-span-8 lg:col-span-7">
        <span
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-widest block mb-4"
        >
          Maquinaria propia. No somos intermediarios
        </span>
        <h1
          class="font-display-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-inverse-on-surface mb-6 leading-tight"
        >
          POTENCIA INDUSTRIAL AL SERVICIO DE LA OBRA Y EL CAMPO
        </h1>
        <p
          class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-container-high max-w-2xl mb-8 leading-relaxed"
        >
          Acondicionamiento extremo de terrenos, excavaciones y plantación GPS
          en Yecla, Jumilla y comarca.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            class="bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary px-8 py-4 rounded hover:bg-tertiary-container transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider shadow-md sharp-shadow"
            href="/contacto"
          >
            Solicitar Presupuesto
          </a>
          <a
            class="border-2 border-surface-container-high text-surface-container-high px-8 py-4 rounded hover:bg-surface-container-high/10 transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider"
            href="/servicios"
          >
            Ver Servicios
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-5 mt-12 md:mt-0 relative hidden md:block"
      >
        <div
          class="relative aspect-[4/3] rounded overflow-hidden shadow-[4px_8px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] border border-secondary/20"
        >
          <img
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="Maquinaria pesada trabajando en el campo"
            src="/images/home/hero-maquinaria.webp"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Nuestras Especialidades -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface relative">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2"
          >Especialidades</span
        >
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-4">
          NUESTRAS ESPECIALIDADES
        </h2>
        <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-secondary mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
        <!-- Card 1: Servicios Agrícolas -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 shadow-[2px_4px_12px_rgba(126,86,39,0.05)] rounded flex flex-col justify-between sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="relative aspect-[16/9] rounded overflow-hidden mb-6 shadow-sm"
            >
              <img
                class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                alt="Retropala trabajando en obra civil y agricultura"
                src="/images/home/card-servicios-agricolas.webp"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Servicios Agrícolas
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Despedregado, desfonde profundo, arranque de viña vieja y
              plantación automatizada con tecnología GPS Topcon.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a
              class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider"
              href="/servicios#servicios-agricolas"
            >
              VER SERVICIOS
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Excavaciones y Obra Civil -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 shadow-[2px_4px_12px_rgba(126,86,39,0.05)] rounded flex flex-col justify-between sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all"
        >
          <div>
            <div
              class="relative aspect-[16/9] rounded overflow-hidden mb-6 shadow-sm"
            >
              <img
                class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                alt="Excavadora trabajando en obra civil"
                src="/images/home/card-obra-civil.webp"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Excavaciones y Obra Civil
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Movimiento de tierras, cimentaciones, apertura de zanjas y
              trituración de asfalto u hormigón in situ.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a
              class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider"
              href="/servicios#obra-civil"
            >
              VER SERVICIOS
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Soluciones Agrícolas -->
  <section
    class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low border-t border-outline-variant/20"
  >
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2"
          >Agricultura Avanzada</span
        >
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">
          SOLUCIONES AGRÍCOLAS
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Item 1: Despedregado -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 rounded shadow-sm sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
              >
                <!-- Icono Piedra con Grieta Central y Granos de Trituración en Base -->
                <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M4 15L7 5L17 4L20 12L17.5 17.5L6.5 17.5L4 15Z" />
                  <path d="M12 4.5L10.5 9L13.5 12.5L11.5 17.5" />
                  <circle cx="4.5" cy="20.5" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" />
                  <circle cx="8.5" cy="21" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" />
                  <circle cx="12" cy="20.5" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" />
                  <circle cx="15.5" cy="21" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" />
                  <circle cx="19.5" cy="20.5" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full"
              >
                Agrícola
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Despedregado de Fincas
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Trituramos la piedra directamente en tu parcela hasta alcanzar los
              35 cm de profundidad. La roca se convierte en gravilla fina in situ.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/servicios#servicios-agricolas"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold font-body-md text-sm hover:underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >
            Saber más
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base ml-1">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2: Desfonde -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 rounded shadow-sm sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
              >
                <!-- Icono Rastro de Arado Recto en Perspectiva (Sin curvas) -->
                <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M2 7H22" />
                  <path d="M2 20L6 7" />
                  <path d="M22 20L18 7" />
                  <path d="M5.5 20L8.5 7" />
                  <path d="M9.5 20L11 7" />
                  <path d="M14.5 20L13 7" />
                  <path d="M18.5 20L15.5 7" />
                  <path d="M2 20H22" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full"
              >
                Agrícola
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Desfonde de Tierras
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Rajamos, ablandamos y volteamos el subsuelo. Enterramos malas
              hierbas y dejamos una cama de siembra perfecta para las raíces.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/servicios#servicios-agricolas"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold font-body-md text-sm hover:underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >
            Saber más
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base ml-1">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3: Plantación GPS -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 rounded shadow-sm sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">satellite_alt</span>
              </div>
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full"
              >
                Tecnología GPS
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Plantación con GPS
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Plantación de viñedo y almendros con máxima precisión. Filas
              perfectamente rectas en una sola pasada de forma mecanizada.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/servicios#servicios-agricolas"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold font-body-md text-sm hover:underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >
            Saber más
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base ml-1">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Soluciones de Obra Civil -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2"
          >Infraestructuras</span
        >
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">
          SOLUCIONES DE OBRA CIVIL
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Item 1: Excavación / Retro -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 rounded shadow-sm sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-secondary group-hover:text-on-secondary group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
              >
                <!-- Icono Retroexcavadora -->
                <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="2" y="17" width="12" height="5" rx="2.5" />
                  <circle cx="5" cy="19.5" r="0.8" fill="currentColor" />
                  <circle cx="8" cy="19.5" r="0.8" fill="currentColor" />
                  <circle cx="11" cy="19.5" r="0.8" fill="currentColor" />
                  <path d="M4 17V11a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6" />
                  <path d="M5.5 12h3.5" />
                  <path d="M11 13l4-5 3.5 2.5" />
                  <path d="M18.5 10.5l2.5 3-2 1.5-2-2.5z" fill="currentColor" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full"
              >
                Obra Civil
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Excavación para Piscinas
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Ejecutamos excavaciones ajustándonos estrictamente a las cotas.
              Extracción, perfilado del terreno y retirada del material sobrante.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/servicios#obra-civil"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-secondary font-bold font-body-md text-sm hover:underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >
            Saber más
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base ml-1">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2: Movimiento de Tierras -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 rounded shadow-sm sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-secondary group-hover:text-on-secondary group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">engineering</span>
              </div>
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full"
              >
                Obra Civil
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Movimiento de Tierras
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Apertura de zanjas para canalizaciones, carga de material y
              levantamiento de pavimentos asfálticos.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/servicios#obra-civil"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-secondary font-bold font-body-md text-sm hover:underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >
            Saber más
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base ml-1">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3: Desbroce Forestal -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-secondary/10 rounded shadow-sm sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-secondary group-hover:text-on-secondary group-hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">forest</span>
              </div>
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full"
              >
                Forestal
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Desbroce Forestal
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Despeje rápido y ecológico. Trituramos árboles enteros in situ para
              la reconversión de fincas y parques solares.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/servicios#obra-civil"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-secondary font-bold font-body-md text-sm hover:underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
          >
            Saber más
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base ml-1">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Potencia y Músculo Técnico -->
  <section
    class="py-24 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface relative overflow-hidden"
  >
    <div
      class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop relative z-10"
    >
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2"
          >Flota y Capacidad</span
        >
        <h2
          class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-inverse-on-surface mb-4"
        >
          POTENCIA Y MÚSCULO TÉCNICO
        </h2>
        <p
          class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-container-high max-w-2xl mx-auto"
        >
          No somos intermediarios. Operamos con un parque de maquinaria propio
          de primer nivel, en constante renovación.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div
          class="bg-surface/5 p-8 border border-outline-variant/30 rounded backdrop-blur-sm"
        >
          <div
            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-full mb-4"
          >
            100% Maquinaria Propia
          </div>
          <h3
            class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-surface-bright mb-4"
          >
            Flota 100% Fendt: Potencia Vario
          </h3>
          <p class="text-surface-container-high mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            El corazón de nuestra capacidad operativa: Fendt 933, Fendt 930 y
            Fendt 722. Tecnología alemana de máxima tracción y guiado por
            satélite, capaz de arrastrar los implementos más pesados rindiendo
            al máximo.
          </p>
          <h4
            class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-surface-bright text-lg mb-2"
          >
            Implementos de Alto Rendimiento
          </h4>
          <p class="text-surface-container-high leading-relaxed">
            Equipos duales para obra y agricultura: Retropala Mixta Caterpillar
            432, Fresadora FI-IVAN "Molino de Piedra", Trituradora Forestal TFT
            Cancela y Guiado Satelital GPS Topcon.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="relative aspect-[4/3] rounded overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-secondary/30"
        >
          <img
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="Flota de tractores Fendt de alta potencia operando"
            src="/images/home/flota-alta-potencia.webp"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: De la Casa Quintana a la Alta Tecnología -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface">
    <div
      class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center"
    >
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <span
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2"
          >Nuestra Historia</span
        >
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-6">
          DE LA CASA QUINTANA A LA ALTA TECNOLOGÍA
        </h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-4">
          Las raíces en la tierra
        </h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Detrás de cada gran máquina hay unas manos que conocen la tierra desde
          niños. Todo comenzó con Pepe en Yecla. Su filosofía era simple:
          trabajar bien y dar la cara. El trabajo duro dio sus frutos.
        </p>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Hoy, con el relevo de su hijo Luis y el salto a la obra civil,
          Quintanamur S.L. es el puente perfecto entre la tradición agrícola y
          la fuerza de la maquinaria industrial.
        </p>
        <a
          class="inline-block bg-secondary text-on-secondary px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider"
          href="/sobre-nosotros"
        >
          LEER NUESTRA HISTORIA
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <div
          class="relative aspect-[4/3] rounded overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-secondary/20"
        >
          <img
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="Historia y tradición en el campo"
            src="/images/home/historia-raices.webp"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Contacto / Llamada final -->
  <section
    class="py-20 bg-surface-container-high border-t border-outline-variant/30 text-center"
  >
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-4">
        ¿Hablamos de tu proyecto?
      </h2>
      <p
